                        <label class="text-nowrap mb-0 ms-2" title="Spatial smoothing — averages neighbouring FFT bins to flatten the noise floor's grass. Higher = calmer floor but blunter peaks. A CW signal is only one bin wide, so smoothing hides it: set this to 0 when working CW.">Smooth</label>
                        <input type="range" class="form-range spectrum-smooth-slider" data-vfo="A" min="0" max="8" step="1" value="2" aria-label="VFO A spectrum spatial smoothing, in FFT bins. Zero is off; raise to flatten the noise floor at the cost of narrow peaks such as CW." style="flex:1; min-width:60px;">
